---
description: "React frontend conventions"
globs: ["client/**/*.tsx", "client/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Tailwind only. Use CSS variables from index.css, never raw hex.
- TanStack Query for all server state. Never fetch in useEffect.
- react-hook-form + Zod resolver for forms.
- Every list has loading (skeleton), empty, no-results, and error states.